WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.890 --> 01:31.160
[My Journey to You]

01:31.180 --> 01:34.080
[Episode 7]

01:35.380 --> 01:37.380
Although you fought me with a saber,

01:37.539 --> 01:38.930
all your moves

01:38.990 --> 01:40.400
were sword lunges.

01:40.780 --> 01:43.259
Besides, I happen to know the sword technique you used.

01:43.259 --> 01:45.120
It was Qingfeng Nine Moves Sword.

01:45.400 --> 01:48.620
It's a top-class sword technique that Qingfeng Sect keeps secret.

01:48.620 --> 01:51.500
And Qingfeng Sect happens to have surrendered to Wufeng.

01:51.500 --> 01:51.960
Tell me.

01:52.310 --> 01:53.620
Who are you from Qingfeng Sect?

01:53.620 --> 01:55.150
I'm not from Qingfeng Sect.

01:56.500 --> 01:58.350
Even the legitimate disciples of Qingfeng Sect

01:58.350 --> 02:00.350
can only master three or four moves.

02:01.100 --> 02:02.190
There are only few people

02:02.190 --> 02:04.140
who can master all the nine moves.

02:04.860 --> 02:06.660
Yet you were saying you're not from Qingfeng Sect?

02:06.660 --> 02:07.630
Nonsense!

02:09.860 --> 02:10.740
My mother

02:11.730 --> 02:13.190
is just an ordinary woman.

02:14.250 --> 02:15.380
Father has been a businessman all his life...

02:15.380 --> 02:16.040
Cut it out.

02:17.170 --> 02:20.970
You've played that card when you were launching the river lanterns.

02:28.260 --> 02:29.760
My father has been a businessman all his life.

02:29.760 --> 02:31.290
He travelled extensively.

02:31.370 --> 02:32.500
Fourteen years ago,

02:32.660 --> 02:34.360
when he was transporting goods by water,

02:34.360 --> 02:35.620
he found a swordswoman

02:35.870 --> 02:38.600
hiding in a secret cabin at the bottom of the ship.

02:39.650 --> 02:40.750
She's the traitor

02:41.500 --> 02:43.560
that Qingfeng Sect had been chasing,

02:44.340 --> 02:45.350
who's known as

02:45.350 --> 02:48.610
the rare swordsmanship genius that may only be found once in 50 years, Zhuo Mei.

02:48.610 --> 02:49.670
You saved her life,

02:50.290 --> 02:52.750
so she taught you Qingfeng Nine Moves Sword?

02:53.370 --> 02:55.770
Actually, my foster mother had her self-serving reasons

02:55.770 --> 02:57.660
for teaching me the sword techniques.

02:57.660 --> 02:59.640
She wanted me to avenge her.

03:01.510 --> 03:02.430
Back then,

03:02.620 --> 03:04.620
Zhuo Mei fell in love with a young man

03:04.890 --> 03:07.150
and violated the discipline of the sect.

03:07.220 --> 03:08.680
The sect leader back then,

03:08.710 --> 03:10.840
who was also her peer senior, Dian Zhu,

03:11.400 --> 03:12.730
punished her severely.

03:15.290 --> 03:16.530
Back then,

03:16.590 --> 03:18.920
this incident shocked the whole martial world.

03:18.920 --> 03:20.920
You must have heard about it, right?

03:22.310 --> 03:22.850
Yes.

03:23.710 --> 03:25.170
I heard from my mother that

03:26.260 --> 03:27.620
Zhuo Mei's lover

03:28.190 --> 03:30.820
lost his hands and feet, and had his mouth sealed.

03:30.820 --> 03:33.620
He was almost lifeless when he was sent to Zhuo Mei.

03:34.070 --> 03:36.380
It's said that Zhuo Mei couldn't handle the shock,

03:36.380 --> 03:38.440
so she went out of her mind and killed a dozen people.

03:38.440 --> 03:39.910
She ran away from Qingfeng Sect

03:39.910 --> 03:41.240
with blood all over her.

03:51.980 --> 03:52.940
Turns out Zhuo Mei who disappeared from the martial world

03:52.940 --> 03:55.090
has been hiding in your place.

03:56.430 --> 03:57.820
So you married into the Gong family

03:57.820 --> 04:01.220
to take revenge on Qingfeng Sect with the Gong family's help?

04:02.730 --> 04:04.190
Foster Mother passed away

04:04.690 --> 04:05.870
a few years ago.

04:08.620 --> 04:09.550
All those years,

04:10.700 --> 04:13.230
she had been depressed and couldn't let it go.

04:13.580 --> 04:14.710
Before she died,

04:15.420 --> 04:16.680
she told my father that

04:18.560 --> 04:21.560
if there's still a place that's peaceful in the world,

04:23.220 --> 04:24.550
that is the Gong family.

04:27.990 --> 04:28.680
All right.

04:29.250 --> 04:30.380
Stop being sad.

04:42.300 --> 04:43.960
Can I go to the back hill now?

04:45.720 --> 04:46.440
Jin Fan.

04:47.340 --> 04:48.390
If that trial

04:48.409 --> 04:50.340
is really as dangerous as you said,

04:50.430 --> 04:52.050
isn't it better

04:52.470 --> 04:55.000
if someone takes care of Gong Ziyu by his side?

04:59.070 --> 05:00.130
There's something

05:00.960 --> 05:02.760
I'm not sure if I should tell you.

05:04.570 --> 05:05.680
We're family.

05:05.710 --> 05:07.430
Just say whatever you want.

05:08.460 --> 05:09.190
I heard from

05:11.970 --> 05:13.100
Shangguan Qian that

05:14.680 --> 05:16.530
Young Master Shangjue and Yuanzhi

05:16.530 --> 05:18.060
were very happy to know that

05:18.400 --> 05:20.080
the Sword Wielder had entered the hill,

05:20.080 --> 05:22.610
and they were talking about doing something.

05:23.420 --> 05:26.220
I don't know the details about what they plan to do.

05:26.360 --> 05:27.260
But they said

05:27.940 --> 05:29.320
it wouldn't be easy for the Sword Wielder

05:29.320 --> 05:31.320
to pass the first round of the trial,

05:31.700 --> 05:33.650
so they'd have enough time to do it.

05:34.340 --> 05:35.000
Oh my god.

05:35.120 --> 05:36.720
What good could they be up to?

05:38.550 --> 05:39.810
They really said that?

05:41.300 --> 05:42.620
We must hurry up.

05:42.620 --> 05:43.930
Let's meet up tonight

05:44.140 --> 05:45.310
and try to send Yun Weishan over to Gong Ziyu

05:45.310 --> 05:47.120
first thing tomorrow morning.

05:47.860 --> 05:48.780
However,

05:48.780 --> 05:51.280
scent tracking is the hardest one.

05:52.100 --> 05:52.860
Besides,

05:53.380 --> 05:55.310
the longest time the scent can last

05:55.340 --> 05:56.550
is only 12 hours.

05:57.580 --> 05:58.320
-No.
-No.

05:59.180 --> 06:00.690
If we want to find the Sword Wielder,

06:00.690 --> 06:02.220
we must go in there tonight.

06:02.650 --> 06:04.110
We may not be able to see him

06:05.020 --> 06:06.280
tomorrow morning.

06:15.190 --> 06:15.970
Ziyu.

06:18.010 --> 06:18.810
Elder Yue.

06:21.470 --> 06:22.480
Why are you here?

06:22.970 --> 06:24.040
I'm worried that

06:24.100 --> 06:25.380
you might be nervous

06:25.510 --> 06:27.910
going through the trial for the first time.

06:27.940 --> 06:30.070
So I'm here to walk with you for a while.

06:32.060 --> 06:32.740
Ziyu.

06:32.950 --> 06:34.280
According to the rules,

06:34.580 --> 06:36.159
you have to cover your eyes.

06:37.270 --> 06:37.610
Okay.

06:46.650 --> 06:47.800
Give me your hand.

06:50.300 --> 06:50.760
Come on.

06:51.860 --> 06:52.300
Ah.

06:53.810 --> 06:54.380
Slowly.

06:55.340 --> 06:57.300
Jin Fan, where are you? Jin...

06:58.710 --> 07:00.180
Jin Fan, you are here.

07:00.180 --> 07:01.640
I've been looking for you.

07:02.050 --> 07:02.450
I...

07:10.200 --> 07:10.870
My Lady.

07:11.020 --> 07:11.900
Can I help you?

07:12.240 --> 07:12.620
Yes.

07:12.870 --> 07:13.670
Let me ask you.

07:14.000 --> 07:15.770
Which color do you like the best, gold,

07:15.770 --> 07:17.180
purple,

07:17.830 --> 07:20.070
or golden purple?

07:20.290 --> 07:22.030
I like neither gold nor purple.

07:22.620 --> 07:23.940
I only like my green jade

07:23.940 --> 07:25.670
and my black guardian uniform.

07:26.420 --> 07:27.220
My Lady.

07:27.620 --> 07:28.940
I still have a task to complete.

07:28.940 --> 07:30.460
I don't have time to mess around with you.

07:30.460 --> 07:31.320
You have a task?

07:32.300 --> 07:35.480
You've always been inseparable from Gong Ziyu.

07:35.520 --> 07:37.030
Now that he's in the back hill,

07:37.030 --> 07:38.430
you should be on holiday.

07:38.770 --> 07:39.990
During the holiday,

07:39.990 --> 07:43.170
you should spend some time on nice things

07:43.650 --> 07:44.680
and nice people.

07:45.960 --> 07:47.260
Before the Sword Wielder left,

07:47.260 --> 07:47.920
he asked me to keep an eye on

07:47.920 --> 07:49.720
Gong Shangjue and Gong Yuanzhi.

07:50.310 --> 07:51.630
Are they important?

07:51.630 --> 07:52.580
They are not,

07:52.730 --> 07:54.130
but the Sword Wielder is.

07:56.700 --> 07:57.500
So

07:58.840 --> 08:01.970
who's more important, me or Gong Ziyu?

08:06.550 --> 08:07.500
Gong Ziyu.

08:32.100 --> 08:32.630
This way.

08:34.539 --> 08:34.940
Ah.

08:41.500 --> 08:41.830
Wait.

08:41.850 --> 08:42.690
Elder Yue.

08:42.940 --> 08:43.450
What?

08:45.280 --> 08:46.610
Are you making a detour?

08:48.600 --> 08:50.200
Why would you say that, Ziyu?

08:50.240 --> 08:52.170
We turned left three times in a row,

08:52.690 --> 08:55.220
and we took similar number of steps each time.

08:55.760 --> 08:56.500
So,

08:57.340 --> 08:59.070
are we back to where we started?

09:01.350 --> 09:02.880
Ziyu, you're smart indeed.

09:03.390 --> 09:04.720
But you are still wrong.

09:05.110 --> 09:05.660
What?

09:06.290 --> 09:06.890
Am I wrong?

09:07.700 --> 09:08.660
If

09:08.810 --> 09:11.230
the height of the secret tunnel didn't change,

09:11.230 --> 09:12.780
then as you said,

09:12.780 --> 09:15.300
we'd have come back to where we started

09:15.300 --> 09:17.490
since we took three left turns or right turns in a row.

09:17.490 --> 09:18.940
But did you notice that

09:20.030 --> 09:21.030
the secret tunnel

09:21.210 --> 09:22.660
is ascending?

09:23.600 --> 09:24.860
I kind of get it now.

09:25.180 --> 09:25.930
Alas.

09:27.990 --> 09:28.790
Ziyu.

09:30.220 --> 09:32.620
They all say you are unruly and rebellious,

09:33.230 --> 09:34.820
but I always think

09:35.620 --> 09:38.270
you are gifted, smart, and kind.

09:38.270 --> 09:39.470
You're also amiable.

09:40.310 --> 09:43.440
You know the names of all the servants in the Gong family.

09:44.300 --> 09:45.450
So they all

09:45.770 --> 09:46.710
favor you

09:47.370 --> 09:48.300
and care for you.

09:50.200 --> 09:51.000
But

09:51.800 --> 09:53.230
you are too young.

09:54.490 --> 09:55.370
Sometimes,

09:56.150 --> 09:57.620
you make rash judgments

09:57.620 --> 09:59.740
out of overconfidence.

10:01.570 --> 10:02.980
As the Sword Wielder,

10:03.610 --> 10:06.340
this kind of rashness can be fatal.

10:11.360 --> 10:12.220
Ziyu.

10:13.500 --> 10:15.250
In your future life...

10:16.590 --> 10:16.950
Here.

10:19.390 --> 10:19.930
Look.

10:23.340 --> 10:26.200
You'll have to

10:26.220 --> 10:28.150
probe and advance in the dark a lot.

10:28.510 --> 10:31.310
And by then, perhaps no one will guide you anymore.

10:32.520 --> 10:34.470
Being alone in the dark,

10:35.060 --> 10:36.700
no matter how hard it is,

10:36.700 --> 10:39.410
you have to make the right decision.

10:40.300 --> 10:41.300
I look forward to

10:41.320 --> 10:43.740
the day you become the real Sword Wielder.

10:44.520 --> 10:45.440
By that time,

10:45.460 --> 10:47.920
I'll help you put on your Sword Wielder robe.

10:52.270 --> 10:52.730
Jin...

10:54.460 --> 10:55.440
Lady Wuji.

10:56.310 --> 10:57.320
Why are you here?

10:57.630 --> 11:00.030
I heard from the servants that you are here.

11:07.650 --> 11:09.420
You are the Eldest Young Miss of the Gong family

11:09.420 --> 11:11.060
and the lord of the Shang Lineage.

11:11.060 --> 11:13.790
How could you follow a Green Jade Guardian around all day?

11:13.790 --> 11:14.800
What a disgrace.

11:16.220 --> 11:20.080
Jin Fan said he can't spend time with me since he has a task to complete.

11:20.130 --> 11:21.520
If he said he has a task,

11:21.600 --> 11:23.260
it must be something serious.

11:23.620 --> 11:25.020
If you keep interfering,

11:25.220 --> 11:26.950
he will only be more disgusted,

11:27.150 --> 11:28.690
distant, and alienating.

11:29.230 --> 11:29.920
I know.

11:30.390 --> 11:32.320
But I just want to keep him company.

11:34.800 --> 11:36.080
Have you heard

11:37.090 --> 11:39.460
a joke rumored among the servants?

11:40.470 --> 11:43.520
The lord of Shang Lineage has three things to do every day.

11:43.520 --> 11:45.850
Eating, sleeping and looking for Jin Fan.

11:48.560 --> 11:52.260
I also want to fulfill the responsibilities of the lord of the Shang Lineage,

11:52.260 --> 11:54.280
but no one takes me seriously.

11:55.640 --> 11:56.530
Father...

11:59.280 --> 12:02.410
Father is just waiting for my younger brother to grow up.

12:02.620 --> 12:04.300
Everyone knows that

12:04.870 --> 12:06.000
I'm just temporary.

12:13.190 --> 12:13.750
My Lady.

12:14.590 --> 12:15.020
Yes?

12:15.350 --> 12:16.210
Tell me.

12:17.100 --> 12:18.860
Why doesn't Jin Fan like me?

12:24.340 --> 12:25.480
The world is vast.

12:26.400 --> 12:29.010
Everything has a reason

12:29.580 --> 12:30.840
and can be figured out,

12:33.130 --> 12:34.260
except love.

12:36.130 --> 12:37.480
Love is inexplicable,

12:39.280 --> 12:40.410
and can't be forced.

12:45.290 --> 12:46.740
But I must force it.

12:48.070 --> 12:49.850
I must get Jin Fan to like me.

12:53.190 --> 12:53.700
My Lady.

12:58.740 --> 13:00.000
Check out the orchids.

13:01.090 --> 13:03.820
This is the third time they've bloomed this year.

13:04.770 --> 13:06.770
The Sword Wielder is so thoughtful.

13:09.670 --> 13:10.930
I'll get the scissors,

13:11.260 --> 13:12.460
lop several branches off,

13:12.460 --> 13:14.390
-and put them in the vase.
-No need.

13:18.390 --> 13:19.320
Throw them away.

13:20.420 --> 13:22.380
Don't you always like orchids?

13:26.900 --> 13:28.700
The flowers only bloom forcibly

13:29.230 --> 13:31.090
after I've used all kinds of means

13:34.460 --> 13:35.890
and tricks.

13:38.220 --> 13:39.280
They smell bitter.

13:42.550 --> 13:42.950
Ouch.

13:43.960 --> 13:44.590
Ah.

13:45.200 --> 13:46.530
Why are you so careless?

13:47.470 --> 13:48.130
Don't move.

13:59.150 --> 14:01.410
It's not a big deal if you want to force it.

14:02.110 --> 14:04.230
I'm just afraid that you may hurt others

14:04.230 --> 14:05.540
and yourself.

14:07.990 --> 14:09.260
It seems to hurt

14:10.180 --> 14:11.670
whether I force it or not.

14:14.530 --> 14:15.470
Poor girl.

14:16.500 --> 14:18.690
Sometimes, taking a step back works better

14:18.690 --> 14:20.240
than pushing too hard.

14:20.980 --> 14:23.110
If one day, you don't like him anymore,

14:23.330 --> 14:25.200
maybe he'll start to like you.

14:25.900 --> 14:26.930
By then,

14:27.300 --> 14:30.100
Jin Fan will be the one to follow you around all day.

14:55.590 --> 14:56.790
You will understand.

15:09.080 --> 15:10.110
Ziyu.

15:11.110 --> 15:13.830
What you are carrying is not your own fate,

15:14.390 --> 15:16.280
but the future

15:16.330 --> 15:18.090
of the whole Gong family.

15:19.080 --> 15:20.700
No matter how hard it is,

15:20.880 --> 15:24.010
you must make the right decision.

15:36.370 --> 15:39.710
[Back hill of the Gong Residence, Xue Lineage]

15:44.230 --> 15:44.860
Ziyu.

15:45.740 --> 15:48.740
You may take off the black cloth and open your eyes now.

16:00.410 --> 16:03.010
The entrance to the Xue Lineage is right ahead.

16:03.430 --> 16:05.830
It's also the first realm you'll be facing.

16:08.060 --> 16:10.660
If you have a thick coat with you, put it on here.

16:10.850 --> 16:12.610
You'll be surrounded by snow and frost-covered leaves.

16:12.610 --> 16:13.740
Keep yourself warm.

16:14.820 --> 16:18.150
I'll stop here since there's someone waiting for you ahead.

16:19.740 --> 16:20.330
Ziyu.

16:22.260 --> 16:22.860
Take care.

16:32.470 --> 16:34.070
Brewing wine with fresh tea.

16:34.420 --> 16:36.350
Melting snow with birchleaf pear.

16:36.530 --> 16:37.640
It's quite poetic.

16:52.120 --> 16:53.180
Young Master Ziyu.

17:03.380 --> 17:04.160
Or,

17:05.609 --> 17:08.010
maybe I should call you Lord Sword Wielder.

17:08.130 --> 17:08.609
Well.

17:09.050 --> 17:10.310
Just call me Gong Ziyu.

17:10.839 --> 17:12.060
It'll be more appropriate to call me Lord Sword Wielder

17:12.060 --> 17:13.490
after I pass this round.

17:16.410 --> 17:18.740
It won't be enough to pass this round only.

17:20.940 --> 17:22.400
What's your name, please?

17:23.300 --> 17:24.300
My surname is Xue.

17:24.450 --> 17:26.579
Xue from "feng hua xue yue", as in the idiom describing romance.

17:26.579 --> 17:29.510
You can call me Young Master Xue, Lord Sword Wielder.

17:30.670 --> 17:31.220
So,

17:31.510 --> 17:33.370
you are a descendant of Elder Xue?

17:33.890 --> 17:34.330
Yes.

17:35.530 --> 17:37.790
I've never heard Elder Xue talk about it.

17:38.550 --> 17:40.780
No one of the Xue family

17:40.950 --> 17:43.660
is allowed to leave the back hill except Elder Xue.

17:43.660 --> 17:45.190
We live here all year long.

17:45.490 --> 17:47.490
Of course he wouldn't talk about us.

17:49.420 --> 17:50.990
What about your other clansmen?

17:50.990 --> 17:53.250
Why are the two of you here by yourselves?

17:53.260 --> 17:54.990
They're not part of your trial,

17:55.570 --> 17:57.630
so there's no need for them to show up.

18:01.690 --> 18:03.240
I grew up in the front hill.

18:04.060 --> 18:04.880
I didn't know

18:05.280 --> 18:08.140
the back hill of the Gong Residence is so extensive.

18:11.500 --> 18:13.770
You are the Trial Keeper of the first round.

18:13.770 --> 18:15.130
Does that mean

18:15.360 --> 18:16.630
the other two clans

18:16.770 --> 18:19.100
also live in the back hill of the Gong Residence?

18:19.100 --> 18:21.270
Young Master Ziyu, you're quick-witted.

18:21.270 --> 18:22.970
After you pass this trial,

18:23.730 --> 18:24.800
you will get to know

18:25.140 --> 18:27.930
the whole picture of the back hill, Lord Sword Wielder.

18:27.930 --> 18:29.230
Looks like there are quite a lot of secrets

18:29.230 --> 18:31.360
in the back hill of the Gong Residence.

18:32.300 --> 18:33.440
It's getting late.

18:34.300 --> 18:35.960
Rest early, Young Master Ziyu.

18:35.960 --> 18:37.260
We'll officially start the trial

18:37.260 --> 18:38.370
tomorrow morning.

18:38.540 --> 18:39.650
There's no need to wait for tomorrow.

18:39.650 --> 18:40.710
Let's start today.

18:40.910 --> 18:41.710
I'm not tired,

18:41.880 --> 18:43.210
and I don't need to rest.

18:43.670 --> 18:45.930
I heard that you made a promise to someone

18:46.150 --> 18:48.520
that you'd pass the trial in three months, Young Master Ziyu.

18:48.520 --> 18:50.380
Is that why you're in such a hurry?

18:52.770 --> 18:53.770
Not for that.

18:55.460 --> 18:57.410
You should take a rest, Young Master Ziyu.

18:57.410 --> 18:58.340
There's no rush.

18:59.910 --> 19:00.770
Xue Chongzi.

19:02.790 --> 19:03.480
Please.

19:12.540 --> 19:13.740
The baggage is heavy.

19:26.170 --> 19:29.830
I've prepared an outfit that you can move around easily in for you.

19:31.810 --> 19:33.210
Thank you, Guardian Jin.

19:33.630 --> 19:35.920
He's only giving this to you because it's his job.

19:35.920 --> 19:37.080
It's not personal.

19:37.940 --> 19:39.070
Don't overthink it.

19:39.870 --> 19:40.870
Her Ladyship and I

19:41.110 --> 19:41.870
will distract

19:41.870 --> 19:44.330
the guardians at the entrance of the secret tunnel to the back hill.

19:44.330 --> 19:46.050
Wait for the right time to enter.

19:46.050 --> 19:47.480
There should be mechanisms in the secret tunnel.

19:47.480 --> 19:48.300
Be careful.

19:50.190 --> 19:50.780
Also,

19:51.470 --> 19:53.200
before entering the back hill,

19:53.510 --> 19:55.570
there's something I need to give you.

20:06.660 --> 20:09.020
Young Master Yue asked me to bring him these herbs.

20:09.020 --> 20:10.220
Please give it to him.

20:28.450 --> 20:31.860
Help!

20:32.740 --> 20:33.680
Oh my god!

20:33.710 --> 20:35.570
It sounds like Eldest Young Miss.

20:35.810 --> 20:36.480
Eldest Young Miss?

20:36.480 --> 20:37.680
Help!

20:37.700 --> 20:38.900
Are you not familiar with

20:38.900 --> 20:40.430
Eldest Young Miss's voice?

20:41.540 --> 20:43.270
How could I be familiar with it?

20:44.480 --> 20:45.410
What do you mean?

20:45.490 --> 20:46.980
I, Gong Zishang, am so beautiful,

20:46.980 --> 20:47.950
gorgeous, and charming.

20:47.950 --> 20:50.640
Am I going to die here today?

20:50.700 --> 20:52.830
Come with me to save Eldest Young Miss.

20:53.830 --> 20:54.590
Let's go!

21:13.270 --> 21:14.870
[Feng]

21:20.580 --> 21:22.510
The longest time the scent can last

21:22.600 --> 21:23.780
is only 12 hours.

21:24.340 --> 21:26.890
The longer the time, the lighter the smell,

21:27.310 --> 21:28.910
and the harder it is to track.

21:29.580 --> 21:30.580
You have to hurry.

21:32.220 --> 21:33.750
The scent is already faint.

21:39.770 --> 21:42.500
I can hardly smell anything but burning candles.

23:21.820 --> 23:22.660
You can go.

23:22.660 --> 23:23.920
I can handle it myself.

23:27.410 --> 23:27.890
Oh.

23:28.650 --> 23:29.740
So you can't speak.

23:31.270 --> 23:33.290
But I don't know sign language.

23:45.140 --> 23:45.540
Oh.

23:45.630 --> 23:46.470
I got that.

24:26.830 --> 24:29.560
There are fewer and fewer snow lotuses this year.

24:30.380 --> 24:32.310
It seems the miasma in the back hill

24:32.630 --> 24:33.630
is getting worse.

25:07.260 --> 25:09.530
I wonder when the miasma will fade.

25:11.580 --> 25:15.090
If the new Sword Wielder can ascend the throne as soon as possible,

25:15.090 --> 25:16.820
I hope he can make a difference.

25:20.350 --> 25:22.080
You have expectations for him?

25:23.750 --> 25:24.840
Don't you?

25:26.590 --> 25:28.990
When Gong Shangjue was trapped for 12 days,

25:30.310 --> 25:32.510
he was almost lifeless when he came out.

25:33.370 --> 25:35.300
His vitality was greatly damaged.

25:36.420 --> 25:38.280
Even Gong Shangjue was like that.

25:38.900 --> 25:40.960
How good do you think Gong Ziyu can be?

25:44.660 --> 25:45.670
Let him try.

25:52.910 --> 25:53.900
Go wake him up.

26:15.990 --> 26:16.760
I'm ready.

26:17.100 --> 26:17.630
Let's go.

26:19.200 --> 26:20.270
You don't need to go anywhere.

26:20.270 --> 26:21.730
Here is where the trial is.

26:53.660 --> 26:54.720
Young Master Ziyu.

26:55.820 --> 26:57.420
This is where the first round

26:57.420 --> 26:59.350
of the Trial of the Three Realms is,

26:59.960 --> 27:01.030
Ice Lotus Pool.

27:04.440 --> 27:05.660
Ice Pool...

27:06.900 --> 27:08.500
I heard it from the front hill

27:09.270 --> 27:10.910
that you've had poor circulation since you were a kid.

27:10.910 --> 27:11.940
You were born incapable of handling the cold.

27:11.940 --> 27:12.550
Yes.

27:13.010 --> 27:15.430
Everyone knows that I have cold intolerance.

27:15.430 --> 27:17.070
This round wasn't deliberately designed

27:17.070 --> 27:18.370
to target me, was it?

27:19.040 --> 27:21.700
You're quite self-complacent, Sword Wielder.

27:25.810 --> 27:27.000
The Ice Lotus Pool

27:27.090 --> 27:29.610
has always been the first round for trial takers.

27:29.610 --> 27:30.670
It's been like this

27:30.810 --> 27:32.210
for over a hundred years.

27:32.530 --> 27:33.390
The water here

27:33.390 --> 27:34.230
is icy

27:34.760 --> 27:36.040
and extremely freezing,

27:36.040 --> 27:37.240
but it never freezes.

27:38.480 --> 27:41.150
There's a box made of black iron at the bottom of the pool.

27:41.150 --> 27:43.480
In it is the Xue family's Saber Scripture,

27:43.880 --> 27:45.410
The Snow Three Moves Saber.

27:46.710 --> 27:48.270
As long as you can dive into the Ice Pool

27:48.270 --> 27:49.490
and get the Scripture,

27:49.490 --> 27:51.290
you'll pass this round of trial.

27:52.600 --> 27:53.960
Dive in...

27:56.060 --> 27:57.590
If you think you can't do it,

27:57.950 --> 27:59.130
just leave the Xue Lineage

27:59.130 --> 28:00.660
and give up, Sword Wielder.

28:00.810 --> 28:02.350
You don't have to be cornered

28:02.350 --> 28:03.480
or suffer from it.

28:24.090 --> 28:25.890
Loosen the soil over there more.

28:28.740 --> 28:29.800
What are you doing?

28:30.710 --> 28:32.040
Young Master Shangjue.

28:32.100 --> 28:33.500
We're planting flowers.

28:35.080 --> 28:35.750
Planting flowers?

28:35.750 --> 28:36.950
Planting flowers...

28:37.180 --> 28:37.710
Brother.

28:37.770 --> 28:39.010
Miss Shangguan said

28:39.180 --> 28:40.570
the orchids in the Yu Lineage bloomed.

28:40.570 --> 28:41.970
They're very beautiful.

28:41.990 --> 28:42.710
So

28:42.790 --> 28:44.650
she gathered us to plant azaleas.

28:45.130 --> 28:46.660
She said when spring comes,

28:46.740 --> 28:50.670
they'd bloom even more beautifully than the orchids in the Yu Lineage.

28:51.260 --> 28:53.990
You're speculating about my preferences again.

29:04.100 --> 29:05.250
Why don't you kneel?

29:28.890 --> 29:30.890
Brother wasn't asking you to kneel.

29:30.930 --> 29:33.130
He was just asking why you didn't kneel.

29:40.830 --> 29:44.190
Brother Yuanzhi, you're good at reading Young Master Shangjue's mind,

29:44.190 --> 29:48.190
while Young Master Shangjue is good at putting people through the mill.

29:48.540 --> 29:50.000
It's wrong whether I kneel

29:50.320 --> 29:51.150
or not.

29:53.120 --> 29:54.520
I grew up with my brother,

29:55.240 --> 29:57.170
yet I dare not speculate about him.

30:05.030 --> 30:06.230
Wipe your face clean.

30:07.810 --> 30:09.550
The most important thing for a girl

30:09.550 --> 30:10.430
is to be clean.

30:11.990 --> 30:13.080
A clean family,

30:14.320 --> 30:15.450
a clean face,

30:17.050 --> 30:18.120
and clean hands.

30:21.530 --> 30:23.660
You are right, Young Master Shangjue.

30:31.950 --> 30:33.750
Remove all these messy flowers.

30:37.830 --> 30:39.230
Only keep the white ones.

30:49.390 --> 30:52.720
Young Master Shangjue said he only wants the white azaleas.

30:55.860 --> 30:56.970
Sorry, everyone.

31:01.510 --> 31:03.130
What's wrong?

31:03.970 --> 31:07.030
Young Master Shangjue said he wants the white azaleas.

31:08.210 --> 31:08.950
Yes.

31:09.240 --> 31:11.280
Sorry that the whole morning's work went to waste.

31:11.280 --> 31:12.410
No, Miss Shangguan.

31:12.440 --> 31:13.510
It’s really something.

31:13.510 --> 31:14.120
Yes.

31:14.250 --> 31:15.510
I've been in the Jue Lineage for a long time.

31:15.510 --> 31:17.380
I've only heard Young Master say no,

31:17.380 --> 31:18.640
or what he didn't want.

31:18.740 --> 31:20.820
This is the first time I've heard him say what he wants.

31:20.820 --> 31:22.020
Yes, Miss Shangguan.

31:22.340 --> 31:24.060
You've only been here for a short while,

31:24.060 --> 31:25.990
and Young Master started to eat chicken and fish,

31:25.990 --> 31:27.060
and he started to ask for things he wants.

31:27.060 --> 31:29.990
What will it be like when you officially get married?

31:31.030 --> 31:32.590
Stop making fun of me.

31:33.070 --> 31:35.490
It must be because Young Master Gongjue couldn't bear to see

31:35.490 --> 31:36.950
your hard work go to waste.

31:37.230 --> 31:38.690
Sorry that I was reckless.

31:38.930 --> 31:41.830
I'll go brew some sugared water for you in the kitchen.

31:41.830 --> 31:42.550
Thank you.

31:42.550 --> 31:43.480
Miss Shangguan.

32:04.080 --> 32:05.340
Once the trial begins,

32:05.620 --> 32:07.010
if you feel it's too hard,

32:07.010 --> 32:07.870
get hurt,

32:08.540 --> 32:10.790
or want to reconsider how to pass it,

32:11.190 --> 32:13.190
you can return to your room anytime.

32:13.620 --> 32:14.630
There's no limit to

32:14.630 --> 32:15.520
when you want to try it again

32:15.520 --> 32:17.380
and how many times you want to try.

32:17.510 --> 32:19.280
However, if you leave the Xue Lineage halfway,

32:19.280 --> 32:20.810
it means you fail the trial.

32:21.550 --> 32:22.550
Young Master Ziyu.

32:22.550 --> 32:23.310
Take care.

32:26.060 --> 32:28.590
Although Yun prepared winter clothes for me,

32:29.610 --> 32:32.010
I can't dive in the water with my clothes on.

33:11.570 --> 33:13.440
Stop crying. Save your energy.

33:14.070 --> 33:15.870
Otherwise, you'll feel colder.

33:21.110 --> 33:22.860
His meridians are different from ordinary people.

33:22.860 --> 33:24.100
He's born with poor circulation.

33:24.100 --> 33:26.030
That's why he can't stand the cold.

33:27.520 --> 33:30.110
So, shall we take him back and make adjustments to his meridians?

33:30.110 --> 33:31.940
There're some snow lotuses left.

33:31.940 --> 33:32.940
What adjustments?

33:32.940 --> 33:34.340
He's from the front hill,

33:34.500 --> 33:36.230
and he's not here for the trial.

33:36.830 --> 33:38.340
He must have got in by mistake.

33:38.340 --> 33:39.410
Just send him back.

33:45.130 --> 33:46.530
So I've really been here.

34:00.780 --> 34:01.620
Lady Wuji.

34:15.980 --> 34:17.030
Young masters.

34:17.659 --> 34:20.389
Why didn't you give me a heads-up before you came?

34:20.659 --> 34:23.179
I didn't even get to prepare hot tea for you.

34:24.300 --> 34:25.719
How rude of me.

34:31.400 --> 34:32.239
My apologies

34:32.260 --> 34:33.790
if we offended you, My Lady.

34:34.400 --> 34:35.409
We're here

34:36.420 --> 34:38.550
to talk about Gong Ziyu's background.

34:42.810 --> 34:44.110
Have you forgotten?

34:45.100 --> 34:46.429
I'm from the Yu Lineage.

34:47.770 --> 34:49.780
Although I'm not Ziyu's birth mother,

34:49.780 --> 34:51.909
everyone in the Gong family knows that

34:51.949 --> 34:53.710
I'm Ziyu's mother nominally.

34:54.739 --> 34:57.470
That doesn't stand in the way of our cooperation.

34:58.880 --> 34:59.680
Cooperation?

35:01.510 --> 35:02.700
Fair cooperation.

35:03.550 --> 35:04.880
We each get what we need.

35:09.640 --> 35:12.140
I've been in the Gong family for so many years.

35:12.140 --> 35:13.670
I've got everything I want.

35:15.190 --> 35:17.080
The Lantern Festival is coming.

35:17.830 --> 35:18.800
Lady Wuji.

35:19.070 --> 35:20.800
Don't you want to take a walk in the streets

35:20.800 --> 35:22.130
and enjoy the lanterns?

35:22.980 --> 35:24.120
I'm old.

35:25.190 --> 35:27.590
I don't want to go to lively places anymore.

35:27.730 --> 35:28.630
I don't mind it.

35:30.270 --> 35:31.340
In this vast world,

35:32.180 --> 35:34.980
there must be a quiet place where people rarely go.

35:35.930 --> 35:37.160
Don't you want to

35:38.300 --> 35:40.230
walk freely somewhere, Lady Wuji?

35:43.260 --> 35:45.260
I can help you leave the Gong family,

35:45.270 --> 35:48.150
and I promise that you can live carefreely ever after.

35:48.150 --> 35:49.310
The Gong family

35:50.860 --> 35:52.520
will never come to bother you.

35:57.500 --> 35:58.450
Is Gong Ziyu's background

35:58.450 --> 36:00.110
really that important to you?

36:01.080 --> 36:03.160
I don't care about his background.

36:04.980 --> 36:07.110
But if he wants to be the Sword Wielder,

36:09.060 --> 36:11.060
I must find it out.

36:14.230 --> 36:15.430
It's been a long time.

36:16.100 --> 36:17.360
There are many details

36:17.780 --> 36:19.240
that I need time to recall.

36:21.620 --> 36:23.640
If you remember anything,

36:25.280 --> 36:26.420
come to me anytime.

36:33.770 --> 36:35.140
We'll leave now.

36:59.990 --> 37:00.830
It's already midnight.

37:00.830 --> 37:02.230
You're always up so late?

37:02.680 --> 37:04.260
Time is money.

37:04.380 --> 37:05.920
Then why are you busy

37:06.170 --> 37:08.350
following Jin Fan around during the day all the time?

37:08.350 --> 37:10.010
The "money" I was talking about

37:10.010 --> 37:11.820
is Jin Fan.

37:12.510 --> 37:15.040
I cherish every second I get to spend with him.

37:15.180 --> 37:17.640
That's why I have to work hard at night.

37:20.670 --> 37:22.800
Laugh if you want. No need to hold it in.

37:24.140 --> 37:25.420
Others laugh at you,

37:25.790 --> 37:27.430
but I only feel sorry for you.

37:28.920 --> 37:30.100
Could it be that

37:30.140 --> 37:31.430
it's the other way around?

37:31.430 --> 37:33.360
You're so tired, living like this.

37:33.630 --> 37:35.170
Does Gong Shangjue ever say he's tired?

37:35.170 --> 37:36.830
Does Gong Yuanzhi ever say he's tired?

37:36.830 --> 37:39.070
The lord of a lineage shouldn't say he or she is tired easily.

37:39.070 --> 37:40.400
But you are just a woman.

37:41.790 --> 37:42.710
So what?

37:43.340 --> 37:45.820
I'm the person who'll revitalize the Shang Lineage.

37:45.820 --> 37:47.440
Among Gong, Shang, Jue, Zhi, and Yu Lineages,

37:47.440 --> 37:49.290
Shang ranks first.

37:55.460 --> 37:56.160
Anyway.

37:59.670 --> 38:00.530
Anyway,

38:01.280 --> 38:03.010
I must make my father feel that

38:03.430 --> 38:04.830
having a daughter like me

38:04.860 --> 38:06.390
is something to be proud of.

38:07.990 --> 38:09.190
It's so dark at night.

38:09.350 --> 38:10.820
There's not even a mouse here.

38:10.820 --> 38:12.550
Who will see how hard you work?

38:13.070 --> 38:15.440
They only see you following Jin Fan around all day.

38:15.440 --> 38:16.060
They only think you're the Eldest Young Miss

38:16.060 --> 38:17.970
who's obsessed with male charm.

38:18.930 --> 38:20.660
I don't care what others think.

38:20.850 --> 38:22.720
As long as I know what it is myself.

38:23.090 --> 38:24.750
We should live for ourselves.

38:25.300 --> 38:26.750
Are you living for yourself?

38:26.750 --> 38:29.010
More like you're living for your father.

38:34.780 --> 38:35.490
I'm sorry.

38:37.720 --> 38:38.780
It doesn't matter.

38:39.190 --> 38:40.930
Anyway, before anything's achieved,

38:40.930 --> 38:42.660
I'll just work hard in silence.

38:43.060 --> 38:43.940
I believe that

38:44.040 --> 38:45.110
one day,

38:45.320 --> 38:46.600
I will make it.

38:47.590 --> 38:49.570
One day, you'll impress the whole world?

38:49.570 --> 38:50.180
Wrong.

38:50.680 --> 38:52.210
I'll shock the whole world.

38:52.380 --> 38:53.310
What we are doing

38:53.450 --> 38:55.600
is something as powerful as thunder and fire.

38:55.600 --> 38:55.960
Yes.

38:57.190 --> 38:58.120
Why did you say yes?

38:58.120 --> 38:59.250
I was talking to him.

38:59.970 --> 39:00.350
Yes.

39:06.730 --> 39:08.250
I've got the herbs.

39:08.790 --> 39:09.860
How about we brew them into medicine

39:09.860 --> 39:10.860
and send it to him?

39:12.070 --> 39:13.270
I heard from the servants that

39:13.270 --> 39:14.450
he had tried several times.

39:14.450 --> 39:16.650
His vitality has been greatly damaged.

39:16.650 --> 39:19.580
If he can't take it, he can return to his room anytime,

39:19.720 --> 39:21.060
get his mind straight and
his energy back,

39:21.060 --> 39:22.190
and try again later.

39:24.550 --> 39:26.280
You don't have to worry so much.

39:29.850 --> 39:31.550
If only he's that

39:31.630 --> 39:33.030
flexible and resilient.

39:34.720 --> 39:36.800
If the rumors in the front hill are true,

39:36.800 --> 39:38.530
he has a stubborn personality.

39:39.070 --> 39:40.670
He'll definitely act tough.

39:40.860 --> 39:44.320
Didn't you say the rumors in the front hill are untrustworthy?

39:46.970 --> 39:47.790
You win.

39:48.590 --> 39:49.960
Since you've got the herbs,

39:49.960 --> 39:51.560
don't brew it into medicine.

39:51.680 --> 39:53.080
It'll be hard to swallow.

39:54.330 --> 39:56.460
Make him a bowl of medicinal porridge.

39:57.690 --> 39:59.660
Put a snow lotus in it.

40:01.510 --> 40:03.770
You seem to have a good impression of him.

40:05.820 --> 40:08.350
I just don't want him to die in the Xue Lineage.

40:09.140 --> 40:10.600
I'll go get the snow lotus.

40:11.660 --> 40:12.230
Well,

40:13.340 --> 40:15.600
should I get an ordinary snow lotus or...

40:16.320 --> 40:17.850
You asked me this question.

40:18.240 --> 40:20.700
That means you have a good impression of him.

40:21.350 --> 40:24.750
You're even willing to give him the snow lotus in the Ice Pool.

40:25.860 --> 40:26.470
Up to you.

40:28.550 --> 40:31.750
I'll go check on the person we caught in the secret tunnel.

40:56.080 --> 40:56.880
Where is this?

40:58.070 --> 40:59.670
Somewhere you shouldn't be.

41:03.500 --> 41:05.030
Are you from the front hill?

41:06.770 --> 41:08.100
I'm from the Yu Lineage.

41:09.110 --> 41:10.770
The Sword Wielder left in a hurry,

41:10.770 --> 41:12.170
and he forgot something.

41:12.430 --> 41:13.600
So I came to find him.

41:15.140 --> 41:17.340
I accidentally got lost in the secret tunnel

41:17.340 --> 41:19.000
and triggered the mechanism.

41:21.040 --> 41:23.270
The fuel in the candles and torches in the secret tunnel

41:23.270 --> 41:24.930
is a kind of special kerosene.

41:26.270 --> 41:28.610
There is a small amount of poison in the kerosene.

41:28.610 --> 41:30.180
If it stays in your body for long,

41:30.180 --> 41:31.910
your limbs will become feeble,

41:32.180 --> 41:33.980
and you'll become unconscious.

41:36.550 --> 41:37.750
Here's the antidote.

41:38.420 --> 41:39.020
Thank you.

41:41.970 --> 41:43.700
I believe everything you said.

41:45.100 --> 41:46.000
But tell me,

41:46.700 --> 41:49.760
why are you wearing the black night suit of an assassin?

42:12.230 --> 42:12.830
Elder Yue.

42:13.460 --> 42:14.980
Are you going out at this hour?

42:14.980 --> 42:15.500
Yes.

42:16.700 --> 42:18.360
I'm going to the Meeting Hall.

42:18.780 --> 42:19.140
Oh.

42:19.220 --> 42:19.820
By the way,

42:21.300 --> 42:22.230
send these books

42:22.330 --> 42:23.510
to the Yu Lineage.

42:24.750 --> 42:25.820
Ziyu told me

42:25.860 --> 42:28.360
he had read all the medical books he borrowed from me.

42:28.360 --> 42:29.690
These are all new books.

42:31.300 --> 42:32.420
Ziyu is still going through the trial

42:32.420 --> 42:34.060
in the back hill.

42:35.420 --> 42:37.780
He can read these when he gets out.

42:38.200 --> 42:38.620
Yes.

42:47.230 --> 42:48.180
Ziyu.

42:49.650 --> 42:51.770
Hope everything goes well for you.

43:22.070 --> 43:23.870
The porridge will be ready soon.

43:23.900 --> 43:25.560
I put a snow lotus in it for you.

43:26.590 --> 43:29.170
This is something that's only available in the Xue Lineage.

43:29.170 --> 43:31.060
It can help you regain your inner power

43:31.060 --> 43:32.520
and strengthen your body.

44:43.420 --> 44:44.750
The Fortnight Flies are

44:45.780 --> 44:47.780
already starting to take effect.

44:48.510 --> 44:49.180
So,

44:49.790 --> 44:50.970
we have to get something important achieved

44:50.970 --> 44:52.100
before the deadline

44:53.260 --> 44:54.590
of the Fortnight Flies.

44:57.150 --> 44:57.800
Or,

44:59.310 --> 45:01.440
do something that can satisfy Wufeng.

45:16.180 --> 45:19.380
What you used is a sword technique, not a saber technique.

45:20.510 --> 45:22.310
You're not from the Gong family.

45:25.010 --> 45:30.720
[The Sword Wielder is injured. The Elder is dead. The dead is silent. The murderer is Anonymous. The best of men is like water. The sharpest saber has no blade.]
